WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.160
Yo, Mr. Miura. We meet again.

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:20.410
So they sent you?

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:25.080
Hey, do you remember the taste
of the sake we shared?

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:26.830
It was good, right?

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:32.420
The one called Miura is gone
from this body.

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:36.340
We'll drink together again...

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:38.050
in hell.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:06.660
Gai, get back!

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:10.290
Remember the promise we made.

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:21.970
Were you close with this Miura guy?

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:24.600
No, I wouldn't call us close.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.810
Honestly, I'm not sure what to do.

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:34.980
I talked a good game for Kyoka,

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:37.780
but it might be dangerous this time.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:39.450
What do you mean?

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.490
I'm out of time.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.290
You mean
you're going to turn into a busoma?

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.960
Yeah. And if that happens...

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:51.710
If that happens?

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:55.630
Promise me that you'll defeat me yourself.

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:00.510
You told me I was weak.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:03.180
You're sure you want it to be me?

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:07.060
Yeah, that's exactly why.
I want it to be you.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:11.600
Promise me.

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:16.980
That if I become a busoma,
you'll defeat me.

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:20.490
All right.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:24.870
Good.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.870
When you defeat me...

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:30.500
you'll realize how weak you are.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:38.380
Administrator Miura...

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:41.510
what drew you to that weapon?

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:49.850
There was a darkness lurking
in your heart.

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:52.350
I didn't know it was there.

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:55.650
What fear drove you to seek power?

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:07.410
Hold on! I'll release you from that place!

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:23.680
I'm coming in.

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:29.680
What? If you want to train,
let's go to the training room.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:36.770
No, fighting a Chrysalis like you
won't teach me anything.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:39.900
So, what's up?

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:42.440
Aren't you afraid?

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:44.320
Of what?

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:48.580
Of being controlled by your weapon
and losing yourself.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:50.870
Is that it?

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:52.830
That won't happen for a while.

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.290
My mind is pretty strong.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.040
But someday...

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:01.590
Well, when that happens,
you can finish me off.

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:05.800
That's just like you.

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.550
Yes, I'll do that.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:10.010
Sorry to make you come here.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.890
That's all you wanted?

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:13.600
I'm kinda busy.

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:17.020
Ichijo.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:21.610
If I ever cease to be myself,
will you stop me?

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:26.490
What are you saying, Mr. Administrator?

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:30.580
Well, if that happens,
I'll punch you really hard.

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:59.060
<i>Ichijo, I beg of you. Save my father!</i>

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:03.320
Ms. Ogata!

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:06.650
Matoba?

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:09.490
You're leaving already?

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:10.820
Yeah.

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:15.450
I've got to get dinner ready,
and I didn't feel like staying.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:17.120
I see.

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.170
So, see you tomorrow.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:21.590
Hold on.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.380
I drew a picture of you.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:27.130
Of me?

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:30.180
Yes. It's not very good though.

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:32.510
Will you take it?

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:34.560
Sure.

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:37.140
Thank you.

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:41.350
Bye.

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:48.700
Master Shin!

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:52.280
I've come to pick you up.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:55.450
How long have you been there?

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:59.330
I see you've been busy
since you transferred.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.290
As I expected of you, Master Shin.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:06.670
Come on, Tokumitsu. It's not like that.

00:07:19.270 --> 00:07:20.140
Damn it!

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:42.120
I'll finish you with this!

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:06.020
Ichijo!

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:11.570
I guess it's over.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:21.910
You're the first one to push me this hard.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.960
And you're a Chrysalis, too.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:27.090
I'll applaud you for that.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:37.140
Break your Chrysalis shell, too.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:38.970
And fight!

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:40.930
No way.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.390
Then die.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:47.940
Gai!

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:51.280
Ichijo. You can't do this alone anymore.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:54.860
I hate to admit it,
but I think you're right.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:56.030
You rest.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:13.880
Wonderful.

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:21.850
<i>I have one chance.</i>

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:23.890
<i>We have to hit him then.</i>

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:37.160
Now!

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:44.660
Gai, go!

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:00.760
Wow! They could win!

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:14.030
I'll give you a big one!

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:30.630
No way. It can't be!

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:32.460
It can't be! That's...

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:36.260
A busoma? Are they allies?

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:40.720
Wonderful.

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.140
Gai, wait!

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:50.560
Demon sword Zsoltgewinn.
Your rage, your anger...

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:53.440
it would be a shame to lose them now.

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:56.030
You bastard.

00:10:57.110 --> 00:10:58.650
It is not yet time.

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:01.070
I don't need your help.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:13.330
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.210
<i>This murderous aura...</i>

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:20.840
<i>it's on a whole different level
<i>than the other busoma.</i></i>

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:32.940
Welcome back.

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:35.400
Yes, I just got back.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:38.110
Where is Lady Himiko?

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:45.580
Kazumo?

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:46.910
I only just returned.

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:50.540
I confirmed that Soin is indeed dead.

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:53.540
I see.

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:55.420
Thank you.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:02.470
But Lady Himiko, there's no need
for you to train at this waterfall.

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:04.090
You can't feel it?

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:07.100
Then you're still weak.

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:10.270
This aura of battle that rises
in the far distance.

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:12.140
This is no ordinary matter.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:17.770
I was purifying myself
so the evil aura did not taint me.

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:22.490
You must focus your mind.

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:23.610
Yes, ma'am.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.450
OGATA HOUSEHOLD

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:28.370
I'm back.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.380
I look so sad.

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:40.920
Ever since Gai vanished,

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:43.050
I've looked like this.

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:50.100
Gai. Will we never see each other again?

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:52.640
I don't want that.

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:57.020
Grimms the Reaper.

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:01.440
The original busoma,
said to be master of them all.

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:04.450
This is my first time seeing him.

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:09.700
I have witnessed the way you fight.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:13.540
For mere Chrysalises, you've done well.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:17.790
<i>Ichijo, get out of there!
<i>He's too dangerous!</i></i>

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:20.590
<i>I'd love to. But...</i>

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:25.970
<i>But I don't have the strength left
<i>to escape.</i></i>

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:30.600
Gai. Leave this to me and run.

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:32.640
Gai!

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:39.360
Wonderful. Even witnessing my might,
you would still do battle.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:41.820
Gai, listen to me!

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:44.030
I shall tell you something.

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:47.950
The age of foolish humanity will end soon.

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:52.410
And the age of busoma will soon dawn.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:54.580
Bullshit!

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:59.670
You too shall break your human shells
and become builders of this new world.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.760
Now is the time to be reborn as a busoma.

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:11.600
Damn. I guess we have to fight.

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:16.480
Is it really okay for me to do this?

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:19.480
I think dad should come.

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:25.320
No. You are now the head
of the philanthropy division.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:29.200
MATOBA GROUP PHILANTHROPHY FUND
TENTH ANNIVERSARY PARTY

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.080
I'm fine being alone.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:44.960
Why did you say that?

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:47.590
Come back already!

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:52.850
The Matoba group has participated
in many philanthropic endeavors,

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:56.470
and has even asked for your help
with contributions.

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:04.070
The goal of our philanthropy is
to give everyone a chance to live happily.

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:07.650
But sadly, when you look around the world,

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:10.820
you see how far we have to go.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:17.830
We realized that we have to remove
the root of the problem.

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:22.130
Today, please let me tell you
what that root is.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:25.090
That root is... violence.

00:15:26.380 --> 00:15:31.720
It's sad, but the history of mankind
is one of violence.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:37.430
Looking back across our history,
only a few eras have been peaceful.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:45.360
And even in the modern era,
wars and terrorism are everywhere.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:50.950
This is a problem that involves everyone.
If the world doesn't become peaceful,

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:55.370
then that day of having true peace
will never come.

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:59.450
Is violence the true nature of humanity?

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.790
I hate violence and its brutality.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:09.510
Violence begets more violence.
It will never be able to bring peace.

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:10.470
Gai!

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:15.300
We'll do the same thing again.
I'll make an opening for you. So you...

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:19.140
Gai. You...

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:26.730
How interesting.

00:16:27.190 --> 00:16:28.020
It's no good.

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:30.570
Gai, at this rate, you'll...

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:34.860
Mahatma Gandhi once said...

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:40.330
that non-violence was the greatest weapon,

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.830
more powerful than any other.

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:50.760
Peace can only be brought about
by mutual understanding and dialogue.

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:55.510
To make peace a reality, you need
the courage to throw down your weapons.

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:58.850
Man who controls the rings of light...
What's wrong?

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:04.850
<i>Damn it. I'm out of power.</i>

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:28.920
Wonderful.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:32.510
Idiot!

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:40.510
Snap out of it!
Why turn into a busoma now?

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:42.890
Move.

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:44.730
Gai!

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:51.230
This battle will not end
until you are both reborn.

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:55.400
I believe humanity's true nature
isn't violence.

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:58.070
I believe it's kindness.

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:02.790
The Matoba Group
will do whatever it takes...

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:05.540
to make a world without violence!

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:19.590
Not yet.

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:21.260
Get up!

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:30.440
Good. Child with a blade for an arm...

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:34.570
Leave your cocoon and become a butterfly.

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:39.070
<i>Kill. Kill. Kill.</i>

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:43.490
<i>Kill. Kill. Kill.</i>

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.080
<i>Kill!</i>

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.130
Gai!

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:05.930
Gai, stop! Control yourself!

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:12.190
Gai! No!

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:14.690
Fool.

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:20.820
You Chrysalises are destined
to become busoma someday.

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:24.780
Why do you deny that and struggle?

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.420
Gai.

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:38.800
You're a pain to babysit.

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:42.550
But I guess you can't help it.

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:08.540
Farewell, Gai.

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:11.290
And goodbye to me, too.

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:14.920
Ichi... jo.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:46.320
So another sad soul has fallen
to the darkness?
